      "desc": "Activates City Fund Benefits once obtained. After activating City Fund Benefits, you can choose one of the following W-Engines: Bloodmarrow Coffer, Radiowave Journey, Cannon Rotor, Six Shooter, Electro-Lip Gloss, Unfettered Game Ball, and Spring Embrace.",
